summary.label:
Welcome to the sweet and delicious world of Cholinko Sweet Ball - a captivating 3D game that will satisfy your cravings and challenge your culinary skills! Step into the shoes of a talented chef and embark on an exciting chocolate-cooking adventure.

In Cholinko Sweet Ball, you are the master chocolatier, responsible for creating mouthwatering chocolate treats. Your journey begins in your very own chocolate shop, where you can purchase a wide variety of recipes. But this game goes beyond just virtual recipes - each one is linked to a real-life chocolate delicacy! Discover the secrets behind classic chocolate treats as you indulge in the fascinating world of confectionery.

Once you've acquired a recipe, it's time to put your skills to the test in the main game. Picture a pyramid with pans, each containing random ingredients. Your ultimate goal is to catch a falling ball and ensure it lands in the correct pan to create the desired chocolate product. It's a race against time as you carefully maneuver through the pyramid, selecting the right pans and ingredients to match the recipe.

The challenge lies in your ability to quickly identify the correct combination of ingredients for each recipe. As you progress, the difficulty increases, pushing your reflexes and decision-making skills to their limits. Can you keep up with the fast-paced action and become the ultimate Choco Chef?
But wait, there's more! Successfully collecting all the required products within a recipe rewards you with bonus points. Rack up those high scores and compete with friends and fellow chocolatiers around the world to prove who reigns supreme in the world of chocolate creation.

In this adventure:
- try yourself as a chef;
- purchase recipes and get real chocolate recipes and cook them to your heart’s content;
- compete with friends for the amount of prepared chocolate;
- get achievements as you progress;
- train dexterity and attentiveness when collecting combinations.

So, are you ready to embark on an unforgettable chocolate-cooking adventure? Get your apron on, sharpen your culinary skills, and download Cholinko Sweet Ball today. It's time to unleash your inner chocolatier and create chocolate masterpieces like never before!
